  "title": "Maple Pecan Pie I",
  "description": "For this rich pie, heaps of pecans are spread on the bottom of a pie shell and covered with a lovely filling made with equal parts of maple syrup and whipping cream, along with a few other tasty ingredients. Bake for an hour and serve.",
